{% comment %}
  Section contract.
  A thread on the talks: the talk_thread web page (templates/metaobject/talk_thread.json), talks UX v4 (owner-approved
  10 Oct, qa/talks-ux/README.md).
  - "← the talks" (TLK-020), the talk: set-nail avatar, "alias · time · topic" (TLK-008/021), the title (H1), the
    body, the real reply count (TLK-022, hidden at 0) and "report" on shoppers' talks (TLK-152).
  - Under the talk: the same friendly box as the hub, smaller ("add your two cents…", TLK-026).
  - Replies, Reddit-style (st-talk-reply): the thread's `replies` list is already in display order; one line per
    level, fold toggles (TLK-179), 4 levels on phones / 6 on desktop then "continue this thread ›" (TLK-178), and
    "reply" on ANY comment opens the box right under it ("replying to {alias}", TLK-134). Draft replies never render;
    a reply whose parent is hidden says so (TLK-180). st-talks.js posts with no name, email or login.
  - "got your own tea? spill it ›" (TLK-168/169) links to the hub's writing box.
  - Desktop (1024+): #MainContent becomes the page grid: this thread in a 720 px column, the house rules (a sibling
    section) in a 300 px rail; from 1280 a topics side nav on the left.
  - On an old the-talks article URL, the page forwards to the thread with the same handle (TLK-147). Any other article
    on this template gets a plain title + body (unchanged).
  @example
  <!-- templates/metaobject/talk_thread.json and templates/article.json -->
{% endcomment %}

{%- capture live_flag -%}{%- render 'st-talk-live' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- liquid
  assign live = false
  if live_flag == 'on'
    assign live = true
  endif
  assign thread = nil
  assign moved = nil
  if metaobject and metaobject.system.type == 'talk_thread'
    assign thread = metaobject
  elsif article
    assign article_handle = article.handle | split: '/' | last
    assign moved = metaobjects.talk_thread[article_handle]
  endif

  assign hub_url = section.settings.hub_url | default: '/blogs/the-talks'
  if blog
    assign hub_url = blog.url
  endif
-%}

{%- if moved -%}
  <section class="st-thread st-thread--moved">
    <p>
      {{ 'small_talk.talks.live.v4.moved' | t }}
      <a href="{{ moved.system.url }}">{{ moved.title.value | escape }}</a>
    </p>
    <script>
      location.replace({{ moved.system.url | json }});
    </script>
  </section>
{%- elsif thread -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign handle = thread.system.handle
    assign t_alias = thread.alias.value | default: 'small talk'
    assign count = thread.reply_count.value | default: 0 | plus: 0
    assign form_id = 'StReply-' | append: section.id
    assign topic = thread.topic.value
    assign current_topic = ''
    if topic
      assign current_topic = topic.system.handle
    endif
    assign topic_label = thread.topic_label.value | default: topic.label.value
  -%}
  <section
    class="tk tk-thread"
    aria-labelledby="StThread-{{ section.id }}"
    data-st-thread-page="{{ handle | escape }}"
    data-st-ago-strings
    data-ago-now="{{ 'small_talk.talks.live.v4.time.just_now' | t | escape }}"
    data-ago-minutes="{{ 'small_talk.talks.live.v4.time.minutes' | t: count: '__n__' | escape }}"
    data-ago-hours="{{ 'small_talk.talks.live.v4.time.hours' | t: count: '__n__' | escape }}"
    data-ago-days="{{ 'small_talk.talks.live.v4.time.days' | t: count: '__n__' | escape }}"
  >
    <aside class="tk-side">
      <div class="tk-side__in">
        {%- render 'st-talk-topics', variant: 'side', order: section.settings.chip_order, hide: section.settings.hidden_topics, current: current_topic, hub_url: hub_url, all_label: section.settings.all_label -%}
      </div>
    </aside>

    <div class="tk-main">
      <a class="tk-back" href="{{ hub_url }}">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 18 14" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M17 7 H1.5 M7 1.5 L1.5 7 L7 12.5"/></svg>
        {{- 'small_talk.talks.live.v4.back' | t -}}
      </a>

      <article class="tk-op" data-st-item="thread:{{ handle | escape }}">
        <span class="tk-op__av">{%- render 'st-talk-avatar', set: thread.avatar.value, alias: t_alias -%}</span>
        <p class="tk-meta">
          <b>{{ t_alias | escape }}</b>
          {%- if thread.posted_at.value != blank %} · {% render 'st-talk-time', at: thread.posted_at.value %}{% endif -%}
          {%- if topic_label != blank %} · <span class="tk-lc">{{ topic_label | escape }}</span>{% endif -%}
        </p>
        <h1 class="tk-op__title" id="StThread-{{ section.id }}">{{ thread.title.value | escape }}</h1>
        {%- if thread.body.value != blank -%}
          <div class="tk-op__body"><p>{{ thread.body.value | escape | newline_to_br }}</p></div>
        {%- endif -%}
        <div class="tk-op__foot">
          <p class="tk-op__count" data-st-count data-n="{{ count }}"{% if count == 0 %} hidden{% endif %}>
            {{- 'small_talk.talks.replies' | t: count: count -}}
          </p>
          {%- unless thread.by_brand.value == true or live == false -%}
            <button
              type="button"
              class="tk-act"
              data-st-report="thread:{{ handle | escape }}"
              aria-label="{{ 'small_talk.talks.live.v4.report_thread_label' | t | escape }}"
            >
              {{- 'small_talk.talks.live.v4.report' | t -}}
            </button>
          {%- endunless -%}
        </div>
      </article>

      {%- if live -%}
        <span class="tk-replyhome" data-st-reply-home></span>
        <form class="tk-hero tk-hero--reply" id="{{ form_id }}" data-st-reply-form data-thread="{{ handle | escape }}" novalidate>
          <p class="tk-to" data-st-reply-to-bar hidden>
            <span data-st-reply-to-text></span>
            <button type="button" data-st-reply-cancel aria-label="{{ 'small_talk.talks.live.v4.cancel' | t | escape }}">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3 3 L13 13 M13 3 L3 13"/></svg>
            </button>
          </p>
          <div class="tk-hero__box">
            <label class="visually-hidden" for="{{ form_id }}-text">{{ 'small_talk.talks.live.v4.reply_placeholder' | t }}</label>
            <textarea
              id="{{ form_id }}-text"
              class="tk-hero__input"
              name="text"
              rows="3"
              maxlength="800"
              placeholder="{{ 'small_talk.talks.live.v4.reply_placeholder' | t | escape }}"
              aria-describedby="{{ form_id }}-status"
            ></textarea>
          </div>
          <div class="tk-hero__row">
            <p class="tk-hero__fine"><span data-st-as>{{ 'small_talk.talks.live.v4.replying_as' | t: alias: '…' }}</span></p>
            <span>
              <button type="button" class="tk-cancel" data-st-reply-cancel hidden>{{ 'small_talk.talks.live.v4.cancel' | t }}</button>
              <button type="submit" class="tk-post">{{ 'small_talk.talks.live.v4.reply' | t }}</button>
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="st-hp" aria-hidden="true">
            <label>Website <input type="text" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label>
          </div>
          <p class="tk-status" id="{{ form_id }}-status" role="status" data-st-status></p>
          <noscript><p class="tk-hero__fine">{{ 'small_talk.talks.live.v4.noscript' | t }}</p></noscript>
        </form>
      {%- else -%}
        <p class="tk-soon">{{ 'small_talk.talks.live.v4.prelaunch' | t }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}

      <section class="tk-replies" id="comments" aria-labelledby="StReplies-{{ section.id }}">
        <h2 class="tk-label" id="StReplies-{{ section.id }}">{{ 'small_talk.talks.live.v4.replies' | t }}</h2>
        {%- assign shown = 0 -%}
        {%- assign pages_nav = '' -%}
        <ol class="tk-comments" role="list" data-st-replies>
          {%- if thread.replies.value != blank -%}
            {%- paginate thread.replies.value by 50 -%}
              {%- for reply in thread.replies.value -%}
                {%- if reply == blank or reply.body.value == blank -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
                {%- assign shown = shown | plus: 1 -%}
                {%- render 'st-talk-reply', reply: reply, live: live -%}
              {%- endfor -%}
              {%- if paginate.pages > 1 -%}
                {%- capture pages_nav -%}
                  <nav class="tk-more" aria-label="{{ 'content.pagination.nav_label' | t | escape }}">
                    {%- if paginate.previous -%}<a class="tk-btn-ghost" href="{{ paginate.previous.url }}#comments">{{ 'content.pagination.previous' | t }}</a>{%- endif -%}
                    {%- if paginate.next -%}<a class="tk-btn-ghost" href="{{ paginate.next.url }}#comments">{{ 'content.pagination.next' | t }}</a>{%- endif -%}
                  </nav>
                {%- endcapture -%}
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endpaginate -%}
          {%- endif -%}
        </ol>
        {{ pages_nav }}
        {%- if shown == 0 -%}
          <p class="tk-none" data-st-empty>
            {%- if live -%}{{ 'small_talk.talks.live.v4.no_replies_thread' | t }}{%- else -%}{{ 'small_talk.talks.live.v4.no_replies' | t }}{%- endif -%}
          </p>
        {%- endif -%}
      </section>

      {%- if live -%}
        <div class="tk-own">
          <p>{{ 'small_talk.talks.live.v4.own_tea' | t }}</p>
          <a href="{{ hub_url }}#start-a-talk">{{ 'small_talk.talks.live.v4.own_tea_cta' | t }}</a>
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </section>
  {%- render 'st-talk-config', endpoint: section.settings.endpoint, live: live -%}
{%- elsif article -%}
  <section class="st-thread" aria-labelledby="StThread-{{ section.id }}">
    <a class="st-thread__back" href="{{ blog.url }}">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 18 14" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M17 7 H1.5 M7 1.5 L1.5 7 L7 12.5"/></svg>
      {{- blog.title | escape -}}
    </a>
    <header class="st-thread__header">
      <p class="st-thread__meta">{{ article.author | escape }} · {% render 'st-talk-time', at: article.published_at %}</p>
      <h1 class="st-thread__title" id="StThread-{{ section.id }}">{{ article.title | escape }}</h1>
      <div class="st-thread__body">{{ article.content }}</div>
    </header>
  </section>
{%- endif -%}

<script type="module" src="{{ 'st-talks.js' | asset_url }}" fetchpriority="low"></script>

{% stylesheet %}
  /* ---------- a talk (v4) ---------- */
  .tk-thread {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 12px 16px 48px;
  }

  .tk-back {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    min-height: 44px;
    color: var(--tk-muted);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .tk-back svg {
    width: 15px;
    height: 12px;
    fill: none;
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-width: 1.6;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .tk-back:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .tk-back:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--tk-accent);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .tk-op {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 48px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 0 12px;
    padding: 8px 0 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--tk-line);
    --st-tavatar-size: 48px;
  }

  .tk-op > .tk-meta {
    align-self: center;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .tk .tk-op__title {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    margin: 12px 0 0;
    color: var(--tk-ink);
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .tk-op__body {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    margin-top: 8px;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .tk-op__body p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .tk-op__foot {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 4px;
    min-height: 44px;
    color: var(--tk-muted);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .tk-op__count {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .tk-op__count[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  .tk-op__foot .tk-act {
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: -12px;
  }

  .tk-op + .tk-hero--reply,
  .tk-replyhome + .tk-hero--reply {
    margin-top: 12px;
  }

  .tk-replyhome {
    display: none;
  }

  .tk-replies {
    padding-top: 16px;
    scroll-margin-block-start: calc(var(--st-header-h, 69px) + 16px);
  }

  .tk-none {
    margin: 8px 0 0;
    color: var(--tk-muted);
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  .tk-none[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  .tk-own {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 16px;
    padding: 4px 16px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: var(--tk-chip);
  }

  .tk-own p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .tk-own a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 44px;
    color: var(--tk-chip-ink);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .tk-own a:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--tk-accent);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1024px) {
    #MainContent:has(> .st-thread-section > .tk-thread) {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 720px) 300px;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: start;
      column-gap: 40px;
      padding-inline: clamp(32px, 4vw, 64px);
    }

    #MainContent > .st-thread-section:has(> .tk-thread) {
      grid-column: 1;
      grid-row: 1;
      min-width: 0;
    }

    #MainContent:has(> .st-thread-section > .tk-thread) > .st-trules-section {
      grid-column: 2;
      grid-row: 1;
      align-self: stretch;
    }

    #MainContent:has(> .st-thread-section > .tk-thread) > .st-tform-section {
      display: none;
    }

    .tk-thread {
      max-width: none;
      padding: 24px 0 64px;
    }

    .tk-op {
      grid-template-columns: 56px minmax(0, 1fr);
      --st-tavatar-size: 56px;
    }

    .tk .tk-op__title {
      font-size: 28px;
    }

    .tk-op__body {
      max-width: 68ch;
      font-size: 17px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1280px) {
    #MainContent:has(> .st-thread-section > .tk-thread) {
      grid-template-columns: 220px minmax(0, 720px) 300px;
    }

    #MainContent > .st-thread-section:has(> .tk-thread) {
      grid-column: 1 / 3;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: subgrid;
    }

    #MainContent:has(> .st-thread-section > .tk-thread) > .st-trules-section {
      grid-column: 3;
    }

    .tk-thread {
      display: grid;
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      grid-template-columns: subgrid;
    }

    .tk-thread > .tk-side {
      display: block;
      grid-column: 1;
    }

    .tk-thread > .tk-main {
      grid-column: 2;
      min-width: 0;
    }
  }

  /* Reddit-style comments: a flat list in display order; one 1.5 px line per ancestor level, continuous across
     consecutive comments (16 px steps on phones, 22 px on desktop). */
  .tk-comments {
    --step: 16px;
    --line: #e6dbd3;
    display: grid;
    margin: 4px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .tk-c {
    position: relative;
    padding: 8px 0 2px calc(var(--d, 0) * var(--step));
    background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(to right, transparent 0 11px, var(--line) 11px 12.5px, transparent 12.5px var(--step));
    background-size: calc(var(--d, 0) * var(--step)) 100%;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    scroll-margin-block: 96px;
  }

  .tk-c[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  .tk-c__head {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0 8px;
    min-height: 24px;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--tk-muted);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .tk-c__head b {
    color: var(--tk-ink);
    font-weight: 600;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .tk-c__av {
    display: grid;
    flex: none;
    place-items: center;
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--c, #fcb939);
    color: var(--tk-ink);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .tk-c__av--light {
    color: #fff;
  }

  .tk-c__to {
    margin: 2px 0 0 32px;
    color: var(--tk-muted);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .tk-c__body {
    margin: 4px 0 0 32px;
    color: var(--tk-ink);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .tk-c__body p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .tk-c__acts {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 2px;
    margin: 0 0 0 20px;
  }

  /* A comment with replies: its own line runs down from the avatar; the "−" toggle sits on it (44 px hit area). */
  .tk-c--parent::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: calc(var(--d, 0) * var(--step) + 11px);
    top: 56px;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 1.5px;
    background: var(--line);
  }

  .tk-c__fold {
    position: absolute;
    left: calc(var(--d, 0) * var(--step) - 10px);
    top: 30px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: start center;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    padding: 4px 0 0;
    border: 0;
    background: none;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .tk-c__fold span {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #fffdf6;
    color: var(--tk-muted);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .tk-c__fold:focus-visible {
    outline: none;
  }

  .tk-c__fold:focus-visible span {
    outline: 2px solid var(--tk-accent);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .tk-c--folded > .tk-c__to,
  .tk-c--folded > .tk-c__body,
  .tk-c--folded > .tk-c__acts,
  .tk-c--folded > .tk-c__fold,
  .tk-c--folded > .tk-hero {
    display: none;
  }

  .tk-c--folded::after {
    content: none;
  }

  .tk-c__more {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 32px;
    padding: 0 10px;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--tk-chip);
    color: var(--tk-chip-ink);
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .tk-c__more:focus-visible,
  .tk-continue:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--tk-accent);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .tk-continue-row {
    padding-left: calc(var(--d, 0) * var(--step));
    background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(to right, transparent 0 11px, var(--line) 11px 12.5px, transparent 12.5px var(--step));
    background-size: calc(var(--d, 0) * var(--step)) 100%;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
  }

  .tk-continue-row[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  .tk-continue {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 44px;
    margin-left: 4px;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    background: none;
    color: var(--tk-chip-ink);
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .tk-c .tk-hero--reply {
    margin-left: 20px;
  }

  .tk-c.is-mine {
    animation: tk-in 420ms ease-out;
  }

  .tk-c.is-pending .tk-c__body {
    opacity: 0.65;
  }

  .tk-c.is-failed .tk-c__acts {
    color: #b00818;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  /* Reported by her: folded away on her device, with a way to look again. */
  .is-reported > :not(.st-folded):not(.tk-c__head) {
    display: none !important;
  }

  .st-folded {
    display: none;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--tk-muted);
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .is-reported > .st-folded {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0 8px;
  }

  .tk-c.is-reported > .st-folded {
    margin-left: 32px;
  }

  .tk-confirm {
    display: inline-flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0 4px;
    color: var(--tk-ink);
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .tk-c.is-mine {
      animation: none;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1024px) {
    .tk-comments {
      --step: 22px;
    }

    .tk-c__body {
      max-width: 68ch;
      font-size: 17px;
    }
  }

  /* ---------- the old-URL forward and plain articles on this template (unchanged) ---------- */
  .st-thread {
    display: grid;
    max-width: 40rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding: 18px 0 28px;
    color: #1a1a2e;
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
  }

  .st-thread > * {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .st-thread--moved {
    padding: 80px 22px;
    font-size: 17px;
  }

  .st-thread--moved a {
    color: var(--st-burgundy);
  }

  .st-thread__back {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    justify-self: start;
    min-block-size: 44px;
    margin-inline-start: 28px;
    color: #1a1a2e;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 15px;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .st-thread__back svg {
    inline-size: 17px;
    block-size: 14px;
    fill: none;
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-width: 1.5;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .st-thread__back:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .st-thread__header {
    display: grid;
    padding: 26px 25px 0 22px;
  }

  .st-thread__meta {
    margin: 14px 0 0 3px;
    color: var(--st-muted-text);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .st-thread__title {
    margin: 12px 0 0 3px;
    color: #111;
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: min(30px, 7.7vw);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .st-thread__body {
    max-inline-size: 276px;
    margin: 6px 0 0 3px;
    color: var(--st-muted-text);
    font-size: 21px;
    line-height: 1.3;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .st-thread__body > * {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .st-thread__body > * + * {
    margin-block-start: 0.6em;
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Small Talk thread",
  "tag": "div",
  "class": "st-thread-section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "hub_url", "label": "Hub link", "default": "/blogs/the-talks" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "all_label", "label": "Topics nav: all (TLK-005)", "default": "all" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "chip_order", "label": "Topic order (talk topic handles, comma-separated)", "default": "plot-twists, tiny-wins, second-opinions, just-venting, nail-talk" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "hidden_topics", "label": "Topics never shown (handles, comma-separated)", "default": "something-else" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "endpoint", "label": "Posting endpoint", "default": "/apps/talks", "info": "The App Proxy path of the talks backend. Change only if the backend moves." }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
